This closes the prior `5e-13` positive-exposure-at-zero-gross case and introduces no apparent contract regression: a genuine all-cash portfolio remains representable with two empty tuples, while every invested portfolio must carry complete classifications. The supplied diff changes only V3 contract validation; V2 source and framing remain untouched.

